{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Catman","In a city filled with anthropomorphic cat-people, Catman lives free of rules and boundaries, doing everything he wants, which often collides with the other inhabitants of the city. Catman dares to be bold: it&rsquo;s made in Flash, which is rarely seen nowadays; there are no spoken dialogue but instead is subbed in Japanese and English and has a original soundtrack made in purpose for the series."],"ja":["キャットマン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":4418,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-4419","ids":{"shikimori":4419,"mal":4419,"anilist":4419,"kodik":"serial-57492"},"kodikIds":["serial-57492"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-57492":"2024-02-19T15:54:39Z"},"title":"Кэтмен","originalTitle":"Catman","alt":"Catman Season One / Catman Series 1 キャットマン","description":"Кэтмен — герой нашего времени. Простой, честный, потерянный. Он живёт в огромном душном городе, который затягивает, засасывает в свою пучину пороков и безнадёжности. Всё, что ему остаётся — это поддаться и наслаждаться своей беспомощностью и одиночеством. Азартные игры, алкоголь, сигареты, пьяный дебош — вот всё, что осталось Кэтмену. Отвратительно, правда? Но это же история не про людей...","year":2002,"type":"ONA","genres":["Комедия","Фэнтези","антропоморфизм"],"rating":5.95,"popularity":1255,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[4418],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/4419/52e2354956090236653cabfc29d8bcc9.jpeg","width":314,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/f840e1adabf6441c44fc7d3addc6f00313960398.jpg","width":864,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-827","dubId":"827","label":"Persona99","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-57492","translationI